Suggests: sshpass
Description: parallel cloning, backup and restoration of files and block devices
 ddpar splits files or block devices into segments processed by parallel dd
 workers. It supports local and SSH-controlled remote transfers, gzip backups,
 SHA256 integrity checks and restoration from validated backup metadata.
 .
 This package includes ddpar, ddpar-restore and ddpar-check, their .sh aliases,
 manual pages and context-sensitive Bash completion.
